# Roadmap status

When a task from the project roadmap is finished, update its saved checkbox in the same turn, before reporting the task as done.

The roadmap is [project-roadmaps.canvas.tsx](/Users/abdshammout/.cursor/projects/Users-abdshammout-abd-app-Pharma-Distribution/canvases/project-roadmaps.canvas.tsx). Completion is stored beside it in `project-roadmaps.canvas.data.json`.

- The state key is `completed-tasks`.
- Each task key is `roadmapId/areaId/title`, for example `backend/b1/Bootstrap, config, and database provider`.
- Set that key to `true`. Read the file first and merge; do not drop other keys.
- The file is a flat JSON object. `completed-tasks` is one property whose value is the map of task keys.

```json
{
  "completed-tasks": {
    "backend/b1/Bootstrap, config, and database provider": true
  }
}
```
